"""Checkora/Checkora#2627 — CI: Add dependency caching to reduce workflow execution time.

Models ci.yml jobs as a prerequisite DAG. Lockfile hashes drive cache keys;
restore order and bust sweeps use hand-rolled adjacency dicts, deque BFS, and
memoized ancestor walks before actions/cache lands in the workflow.
